<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef generally steady on moderate demand and offerings.  Select and Choice rib and chuck cuts steady to firm, while round and loin cuts steady to weak. Beef trimmings firm on light demand and offerings. -USDA</p>
<p>-----</p>
<p>-----</p>
